{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18067","headline":"将归赠孟东野房蜀客 · 韩愈","name":"将归赠孟东野房蜀客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君门不可入，势利互相推。\n借问读书客，胡爲在京师。\n举头未能对，闭眼聊自思。\n倏忽十六年，终朝苦寒饥。\n宦途竟寥落，鬓发坐差池。\n颍水清且寂，箕山坦而夷。\n如今便当去，咄咄无自疑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18067.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18067","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}